  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 402.22 “Transfer of customer base” means the acquisition through a sale or transfer of all or a part of the customer base of another carrier.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400)",
